 render_theorem(sec, "105-42 Mod-9 Invariance (Theorem 182)", "105 - 42 = 3^2*7 = 63 = 2^6-1 makes Z/9 the UNIQUE channel where 105 and 42 are indistinguishable (both residue 6 mod 3^2=9). In mixed additive sequences, Z/9 channel prediction is deterministic (1000 ppt) while all others are ~500 ppt. The mod-9 channel is the unique algebraic bridge between 105 and 42. 13/13 verified.");
